& [Fold1Identity] keeps five root uses residual records cases readers and gate dispositions distinct
  + equal type or equal content never merges base and preparation response intent

& [Fold2Ingress] walks exact bytes before Value authority
  + UTF-8 lexical completion duplicate refusal path accounting and limits are one atomic gate
  + schema receives only a FaithfulJsonInstance and serde independently receives original bytes

& [Fold3ResidualGraph] maps syntax gaps to actual enforcement
  + root -> type -> residual -> class -> stage -> module -> function -> proof
  + dangling duplicate unimplemented-as-passed and schema-discharged residual edges fail

& [Fold4Conformance] triangulates expectation schema serde and optional semantics
  + applicability decides which comparison is meaningful
  + disagreement preserves both sides rather than choosing a winner from authority rank

& [Fold5Faculties] coordinates purpose
  + Observer accounts bytes structures cases readers rules residuals findings and limits
  + Honesty protects distinctions among parsed schema-valid serde-valid semantic-valid and admitted
  + Security refuses duplicate keys external references stale artifacts unbounded diagnostics and hidden resolver capability
  + Scribe preserves exact fixtures expectations observations and content digests
  + Refiner normalizes diagnostics and removes false equivalence claims
  + Weaver joins roots rules residuals cases readers and coverage without merging identity
  + Planner orders prerequisite integrity before readers and readers before report and activation

& [Fold6Adversary] attacks erased and ambiguous information
  + root and nested duplicate keys trailing values numeric edge representation recursive depth unresolved reference mismatched expectations skipped-reader agreement stale residual and nondeterministic ordering

& [Fold7Growth] provides later proof input without granting later authority
  + I04 may consume exact schemas and residual registry for provider-neutral structural definitions
  + I05 may consume conformance reports and exact baselines for compatibility and release audit
  + no provider projection model execution effect hardware or production claim follows
